Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(442.043,153)}Painting Appraiser
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.77,0:00:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a genuine hand drawn painting by Renoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very expensive. Isn't that incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the paintings you see here are the part of my father's exclusive collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All art that you see here are genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,However especially this one was the most expensive painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That artwork looks exactly like one I painted few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so naive, it's Picasso's painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.67,0:00:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A real art by Picasso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How can Piccasso's artwork could be same as yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible, you never can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't say...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.81,0:00:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Our snack today is Dorayaki. Have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.15,0:00:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you upto?
